{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}Privacy Policy - FEU Institute of Technology{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
<div class="bg-slate-50 min-h-screen py-12 md:py-20 relative overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Decorative background elements -->
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-feu-green opacity-5 rounded-bl-full pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-64 h-64 bg-feu-yellow opacity-10 rounded-tr-full pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 relative z-10">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-xl shadow-slate-200/50 border border-slate-100 p-8 md:p-12 lg:p-16">
            <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-feu-green mb-6 border-b-2 border-feu-yellow pb-4 inline-block">Privacy Policy</h1>
            
            <div class="space-y-8 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center mb-10 p-8 bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100">
                    <img src="https://www.feutech.edu.ph/feutech/assets/img/pages/dpo_seal.png" alt="DPO Seal" class="w-64 md:w-80 h-auto mb-6 drop-shadow-md">
                    <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 text-center">National Privacy Commission 2024 Seal of Registration</p>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-10">
                    <section>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-feu-green mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-feu-yellow text-xl">1.</span> Introduction</h3>
                        <div class="space-y-4">
                            <p>This is the official website of the FEU Institute of Technology. We have developed this Privacy Policy to notify you about our privacy practices. We value your rights to privacy that any personal information collected on or through this site will be treated in accordance with Republic Act No. 10173, or the Data Privacy Act of 2012, and its Implementing Rules and Regulations.</p>
                            <p>Other domains such as the FEU Institute of Technology Student Portal, Canvas managed or maintained by the FEU Institute of Technology, including those by affiliated units, may be covered by a separate and different policy.</p>
                            <p>The services on this web page are not intended for minors. In the event that a person is under 18 years old, they must get prior consent from the parent or legal guardian in compliance with the Republic Act No. 10173.</p>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <section>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-feu-green mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-feu-yellow text-xl">2.</span> Information Gathering and Usage</h3>
                        <div class="space-y-4">
                            <p>As part of the security protocol that uses a firewall, this site automatically records technical information about your visit.</p>
                            <p>This may be used for general purposes such as products and services provision, geocoding and location mapping, identification and authentication, services improvement, and research. This may also include the following:</p>
                            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 marker:text-feu-yellow">
                                <li>Page interaction information</li>
                                <li>Page response time</li>
                                <li>Pages viewed and searched for</li>
                                <li>Time zone settings</li>
                                <li>IP address</li>
                                <li>Date and time of visit and connection</li>
                                <li>Browser type and version</li>
                                <li>Use of Google Analytics</li>
                            </ul>
                            <p>This site makes use of cookies which are small amounts of data that often include an anonymous unique identifier that is sent to your browser from a website’s computers and stored on your device memory. We use cookies to make websites work efficiently, as well as to provide information to the owners of the website.</p>
                            <p>Cookies are required to use our services to record current session information. You are required to log in to your FEU Institute of Technology site after a certain period of time has elapsed to protect you against others accidentally accessing your account contents.</p>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <section>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-feu-green mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-feu-yellow text-xl">3.</span> Storage and Retention</h3>
                        <div class="space-y-4">
                            <p>All information collected that is maintained by the Institute is stored using our third-party service providers and hosting partners to provide the necessary hardware, software, networking, storage, and related technology required to run FEU Institute of Technology which can only be accessed by the authorized personnel and agents.</p>
                            <p>The information collected is aggregated until its declared purpose has been achieved.</p>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <section>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-feu-green mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-feu-yellow text-xl">4.</span> Sharing and Disclosure</h3>
                        <p class="mb-4">The information collected is not shared with or sold to other organizations for commercial purposes except for the following circumstances:</p>
                        <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-3 marker:text-feu-green marker:font-bold">
                            <li>When you permitted FEU Institute of Technology to use your information.</li>
                            <li>When it is necessary to share information in order to investigate, prevent, or take action regarding illegal activities, suspected fraud, situations involving potential threats to the physical safety of any person, violations of our Privacy Policy, or otherwise required by law.</li>
                            <li>When we transfer information about you in the event that FEU Institute of Technology is acquired by or merged with another company. FEU Institute of Technology will notify you before the information about you is transferred and becomes subject to a different policy.</li>
                            <li>FEU Institute of Technology may disclose personal information under special circumstances, such as to comply with subpoenas or when your actions violate the Privacy Policy.</li>
                        </ol>
                    </section>

                    <section>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-feu-green mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-feu-yellow text-xl">5.</span> Security</h3>
                        <div class="space-y-4">
                            <p>To ensure the confidentiality of the personal data we collect, use, and maintain, we have adopted the technical and organizational measures necessary to prevent the alteration, loss, unauthorized processing, or access of the collected personal data. However, as effective as our security measures are, we still cannot guarantee the security of our database whenever the information you provide us is transmitted over the Internet.</p>
                            <p>We ask that you remain responsible in sharing confidential information such as passwords, e-mails, contact numbers, and other personal information that you use to access the internet or other mobile applications.</p>
                            <p>We encourage you to report any vulnerabilities that may be found in our webpage or any application through our webpage to our Data Privacy Office.</p>
                            <div class="bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100 inline-block mt-2">
                                <span class="font-medium text-slate-700 mr-2">Email:</span> <a href="mailto:dataprivacy@feutech.edu.ph" class="text-feu-green hover:underline font-medium">dataprivacy@feutech.edu.ph</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <section>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-feu-green mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-feu-yellow text-xl">6.</span> Your Rights</h3>
                        <p class="mb-4">As the data subject, you are granted the following rights as written in the RA 10173 or the Data Privacy Act of 2012.</p>
                        <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-3 marker:text-feu-green marker:font-bold mb-6">
                            <li>You have the right to be informed that your personal data will be, are being, or were, collected and processed.</li>
                            <li>You have the right to demand access from an organization to any information relating to you that they have on their database.</li>
                            <li>You have the right to object if the personal data processing involved is based on consent or on legitimate interest.</li>
                            <li>You have the right to suspend, withdraw, or order the blocking, or destruction of your personal data.</li>
                            <li>You have the right to claim compensation in the event that you suffered damages due to any violation of your rights and freedoms as data subject.</li>
                            <li>You have the right to file a complaint with the National Privacy Commission in any case that you feel that your data privacy rights have been violated.</li>
                            <li>You have the right to data portability. It allows you to manage your personal data and assures that you have full control over your own data.</li>
                        </ol>
                        
                        <div class="bg-feu-green/5 border border-feu-green/20 p-6 rounded-2xl">
                            <p class="font-medium text-slate-800 mb-3">For any questions and/or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please contact:</p>
                            <address class="not-italic text-sm space-y-1">
                                <strong class="text-feu-green block text-base mb-2">The Data Protection Officer</strong>
                                FEU Institute of Technology<br>
                                P. Paredes Street, Sampaloc, Manila<br>
                                <span class="block mt-2 font-medium text-slate-700">+632 82818888</span>
                                <span class="block text-feu-green hover:underline">
                                    <a href="mailto:dataprivacy@feutech.edu.ph">dataprivacy@feutech.edu.ph</a>
                                </span>
                            </address>
                        </div>
                    </section>

                    <section>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-feu-green mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-feu-yellow text-xl">7.</span> Changes</h3>
                        <p>FEU Institute of Technology reserves the right to make changes to this Policy from time to time. Should there be any significant changes, we will notify you by sending a notice to your primary email address specified in your FEU Institute of Technology account or by placing a prominent notice on our site. If you are a regular visitor to this webpage, we recommend that you check this Privacy Policy on a regular basis.</p>
                    </section>
                </div>
                
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
{% endblock %}
